+ * Server-to-client prots of the Android client, build 241.4, that have been identified so far.
+ *
+ * Opcodes are indices into the client's server-packet size table (.rodata 0x104c4c, 151 entries,
+ * read by the packet reader at Ghidra 0x5da16c); each one was matched by reading its case in the
+ * packet dispatcher (Ghidra 0x541dd4). See docs/android-protocol.md in the test-server project.
+ *
+ * Tags on entries added in the 2026-10-16 pass: "dispatcher case read" = the prot was matched by
+ * reading its dispatcher case (field reads/transforms compared with RSProt's desktop encoder);
+ * "unverified" = identity or layout is weaker (reason given); "verified live" = confirmed on device.
+ */
